; Logical tensor payloads and their exact conversions for the inference
; comparison coordinator: immutable owned blobs with a lease ledger, the
; streaming payload-digest seam (backends are registered by algorithm id),
; element codecs, logical values and the conversion-recipe validator and
; evaluator. Pure: depends on the schema layer, [err_trace] and [fmt] only, so
; no engine, compiler, Unix or libtorch dependency reaches it. Sizes and
; element counts are [int64] until bounded by [Sys.max_string_length], so
; nothing here assumes a 63-bit [int]. See .ai/ (the inference comparison
; schema layer).

(library
 (name inference_compare_codecs)
 (libraries err_trace fmt inference_compare_schema))
